    {
      "id": "NDq8yK9NdpuFtW6j5egu_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1861.0553578422184,
      "y": 1084.4697976623263,
      "width": 453.385944010417,
      "height": 271.3333333333331,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 825539948,
      "version": 268,
      "versionNonce": 1273573100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "lkK3KgHRxLeN2P-mEfx47",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1788463825414,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DETAILS\n\n* std::list<std::shared_ptr<CacheNode>>\n(LRU Tracking List)\n* Doubly-linked list maintaining\nchronological usage order.\n* Executes O(1) updates via\nstd::list::splice to move hit nodes\ndirectly to the head.\n* Enables O(1) tail eviction for expired\nor stale nodes.",
      "fontSize": 19.733333333333313,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DETAILS\n\n* std::list<std::shared_ptr<CacheNode>> (LRU Tracking List)\n* Doubly-linked list maintaining chronological usage order.\n* Executes O(1) updates via std::list::splice to move hit nodes directly to the head.\n* Enables O(1) tail eviction for expired or stale nodes.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qH4u3-srg0poDpb2E1m-S",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440.79607434499826,
      "y": 563.6678198632743,
      "width": 450.44565836588527,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 458838508,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 2091379564,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788462451903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DETAILS\n\n* std::queue<Request> inside\nThreadSafeQueue (Task Buffer)\n* FIFO task queue buffering incoming\nclient socket descriptors and queries.\n* Enforces a strict max_capacity bound\nto provide fast-rejection load shedding\nduring traffic spikes.\n\n\n\nFEATURES\n\n*Bounded Load Shedding (Backpressure\nProtection) - Restricts queue size to\nprevent out-of-memory (OOM) kernel\npanics.\n* Instantly returns `[ERROR]\nSERVER_BUSY_QUEUE_FULL` and closes\nsockets when max capacity is reached.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DETAILS\n\n* std::queue<Request> inside ThreadSafeQueue (Task Buffer)\n* FIFO task queue buffering incoming client socket descriptors and queries.\n* Enforces a strict max_capacity bound to provide fast-rejection load shedding during traffic spikes.\n\n\n\nFEATURES\n\n*Bounded Load Shedding (Backpressure Protection) - Restricts queue size to prevent out-of-memory (OOM) kernel panics.\n* Instantly returns `[ERROR] SERVER_BUSY_QUEUE_FULL` and closes sockets when max capacity is reached.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
