    {
      "id": "KpgiXVo6vaC78bhgrAUxL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2950.4577649888574,
      "y": 602.3345758120198,
      "width": 524.869890485491,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1698709100,
      "version": 521,
      "versionNonce": 1476612948,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788464122331,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DETAILS\n\n* std::queue<std::unique_ptr<pqxx::connection>>\n(Connection Pool)\n* Pre-allocates and recycles active PostgreSQL\nTCP handles.\n* Blocks workers when all connections are\nchecked out and wakes them upon return via\ncondition variable signaling.\n\nFEATURES\n\n* Zero TCP Handshake Overhead for Database\nReads - Uses a dedicated connection pool to\neliminate the cost of renegotiating DataBase\nauthentication and TCP handshakes per query.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DETAILS\n\n* std::queue<std::unique_ptr<pqxx::connection>>  (Connection Pool)\n* Pre-allocates and recycles active PostgreSQL TCP handles.\n* Blocks workers when all connections are checked out and wakes them upon return via condition variable signaling.\n\nFEATURES\n\n* Zero TCP Handshake Overhead for Database Reads - Uses a dedicated connection pool to eliminate the cost of renegotiating DataBase authentication and TCP handshakes per query.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YoGq9NGNg0dG9a2pYE_BO",
