    {
      "id": "y-B1KCRVNhBrKblo_e9YT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3159.5052201861486,
      "y": -657.612504652581,
      "width": 617.760602678571,
      "height": 426.66666666666674,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1066605524,
      "version": 422,
      "versionNonce": 980746220,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788463327752,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DETAILS\n\n* std::atomic<T> Counters (Lock-Free Telemetry Bus)\n* Tracks high-frequency counters (`total_requests`,\n`active_workers`, `cache_hits`, `cache_misses`,\n`total_processing_time_us`) without lock contention.\n\nFEATURES\n\n* Real-Time Telemetry Dashboard - Streams live\nmetrics over TCP using dedicated commands (`STATS`,\n`STATS_JSON`) without disrupting query execution\nthreads.\n* Integrates with a lightweight web interface to\nvisualize live throughput, hit rates, active\nthreads, and comparative DB latency.",
      "fontSize": 21.333333333333336,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DETAILS\n\n* std::atomic<T> Counters (Lock-Free Telemetry Bus)\n* Tracks high-frequency counters (`total_requests`, `active_workers`, `cache_hits`, `cache_misses`, `total_processing_time_us`) without lock contention.\n\nFEATURES\n\n* Real-Time Telemetry Dashboard - Streams live metrics over TCP using dedicated commands (`STATS`, `STATS_JSON`) without disrupting query execution threads.\n* Integrates with a lightweight web interface to visualize live throughput, hit rates, active threads, and comparative DB latency.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
