      "seed": 1135783508,
      "version": 23,
      "versionNonce": 112320236,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788463267697,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*Zero TCP Handshake Overhead for Database Reads**",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*Zero TCP Handshake Overhead for Database Reads**",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tDjoglgwcDditQznPoFNZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3333.6451330071413,
      "y": -222.92216474670852,
      "width": 785.4036254882812,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 148181228,
      "version": 23,
      "versionNonce": 1561384404,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788463267697,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Uses a dedicated connection pool to eliminate the\ncost of renegotiating PostgreSQL authentication and\nTCP handshakes per query.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Uses a dedicated connection pool to eliminate the cost of renegotiating PostgreSQL authentication and TCP handshakes per query.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "viocgvwHrauRZ3jhqx93R",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2961.2278663998586,
      "y": 1468.6797442549641,
      "width": 978.7892084536691,
      "height": 385.76923076923094,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 526565460,
      "version": 814,
      "versionNonce": 92198100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788464452368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Complexity & Extended Cache\n\nTime Complexity\n* Cache Hit — O(1): Instant hash directory lookup and linked-list head promotion via pointer\nsplicing.\n* Cache Eviction — O(1) Amortized: Backward scan quickly drops resolved tail nodes without\nfull table sweeps.\n* Cache Miss & Coalescing — O(1) Overhead + O(Q_db): Reserves slot in O(1); time bounded\nonly by the DataBase query, while follower threads wait without re-querying.\n* Queue Ingestion — O(1): Thread-safe enqueue and dequeue with zero search overhead.\n\nSpace Complexity\n* Strictly Bounded — O(C + Q + P)\n* Cache entries: O(C) where C is max cachelines.\n* Task backlog: O(Q) bounded by max queue size (prevents OOM crashes).\n* DB pool: O(P) holding pre-allocated connection handles.",
      "fontSize": 19.28846153846155,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Complexity & Extended Cache\n\nTime Complexity\n* Cache Hit — O(1): Instant hash directory lookup and linked-list head promotion via pointer splicing.\n* Cache Eviction — O(1) Amortized: Backward scan quickly drops resolved tail nodes without full table sweeps.\n* Cache Miss & Coalescing — O(1) Overhead + O(Q_db): Reserves slot in O(1); time bounded only by the DataBase query, while follower threads wait without re-querying.\n* Queue Ingestion — O(1): Thread-safe enqueue and dequeue with zero search overhead.\n\nSpace Complexity\n* Strictly Bounded — O(C + Q + P)\n* Cache entries: O(C) where C is max cachelines.\n* Task backlog: O(Q) bounded by max queue size (prevents OOM crashes).\n* DB pool: O(P) holding pre-allocated connection handles.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "FioeM23Q_pknOerJHuH-E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2127.7113107726714,
      "y": 1586.1797442549635,
      "width": 612.6011538374806,
      "height": 261.6666666666661,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 305951852,
      "version": 976,
      "versionNonce": 1583284052,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "lkK3KgHRxLeN2P-mEfx47",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1788463856147,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Extended Cache System\n\n* Stateful Life Cycle: Atomic transitions\n(`IN_PROGRESS`→`READY`/`FAILED`) allow slot reservation\nbefore data is fetched\n* Two-Tier Locking: Global mutex only guards quick pointer\nshifts; slow DB fetches run on per-node locks so other\ncache hits remain non-blocking.\n* Live Byte Accounting: Atomic counters track exact\npayload memory during every write, expiration, and\neviction.",
      "fontSize": 19.030303030302992,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Extended Cache System\n\n* Stateful Life Cycle: Atomic transitions (`IN_PROGRESS`→`READY`/`FAILED`) allow slot reservation before data is fetched\n* Two-Tier Locking: Global mutex only guards quick pointer shifts; slow DB fetches run on per-node locks so other cache hits remain non-blocking.\n* Live Byte Accounting: Atomic counters track exact payload memory during every write, expiration, and eviction.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
